{"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le08ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Socializing"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You can make invitations when you talk about special occasions.<br />  You use modal verbs like <span class=\"italic\">Would you\u2026?</span>   or <span class=\"italic\">Should we\u2026?</span> for formal invitations.<br />  You use expressions like <span class=\"italic\">Let's\u2026</span>   or <span class=\"italic\">Why don't\u2026?</span>   for informal or casual invitations.<br /><br />  When you are the customer, it is important to use polite words and expressions when you make a request.<br /> When you work in a restaurant, you use polite words and expressions to ask someone if they are ready to order.<br />"}, {"type": "example", "content": "  <span class =\"strong\">Ann</span>: Shall we go to a restaurant tonight?<br />    <span class =\"strong\">Bob</span>: I would love that, thank you.<br />   <span class =\"strong\">Waiter</span>: Are you ready to order?<br />  <span class =\"strong\">Ann</span>: Yes. I'd like to start with some appetizers, please.<br />"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Formal Invitations </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Informal Invitations </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Responding to Invitations </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Would you \u2026 ? </span><br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Should we \u2026 ?</span><br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Shall we \u2026 ?</span><br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\">I would like to ... </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Let's \u2026 </span><br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Why don't \u2026 ?</span><br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\">How about \u2026 ?</span><br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Do you want to \u2026 ?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Yes, that would be very nice.</span><br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'd love that.</span><br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'd love to, but ... </span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":11,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Question </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Answer</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Customer<br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\">May I see the menu? </span><br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Do you have anything vegetarian? </span><br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could we have \u2026 ? </span><br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\">We'd like to hear your specials, please. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Waiter<br /> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Certainly, Sir/Madam/Miss. </span><br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Yes, we have \u2026 </span><br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Tonight, the specials are ... </span><br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\">With pleasure.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Waiter/Waitress<br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Are you ready to order? </span><br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Would you like to start with \u2026 ? </span><br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can I get you some drinks to start?</span><br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Will that be all?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Customer<br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Yes. I'd like \u2026 </span><br /><span class=\\\"italic\\\">I need a few more minutes.</span><br />\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Question</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Answer</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class =\\\"strong\\\">Customer asks the  waiter . . .\\t</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">May I see the menu?    </span><br />   <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Do you have anything vegetarian?</span><br />   C<span class=\\\"italic\\\">ould we have \u2026 ?</span><br />  <span class=\\\"italic\\\"> We'd like to hear your specials, please.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Certainly, Sir/Madam/Miss.    </span><br />   <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Yes, we have \u2026 </span><br />   <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Tonight, the specials are ... </span><br />   <span class=\\\"italic\\\">With pleasure.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"strong\\\">Waiter / Waitress  asks the customer . . .    </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Are you ready to order?    </span><br />   <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Would you like to start with \u2026 ?    </span><br />   <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can I get you some drinks to start?    </span><br />   <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Will that be all?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Yes. I'd like \u2026 </span><br />   <span class=\\\"italic\\\">I need a few more minutes.</span><br />   <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Yes, thank you very much.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "a while ago "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a long time in the past "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I bought my ticket a while ago."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you can review."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Are you kidding me? "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "Are you serious?; Really? "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: <span class =\"strong\">Ann</span>: I bought a one-way ticket to Paris. Bob: Are you kidding me?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "I didn't see that one coming! "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "I wasn't expecting this; I'm surprised "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: <span class =\"strong\">Bob</span>: Ann is leaving tomorrow. I didn't see that one coming!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to take care of something "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be responsible for something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I can call the restaurant and you take care of the invitations."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "farewell "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "parting; when someone is leaving for a long time "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We should have a farewell dinner for Vanessa!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cocktail "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a mixed drink, usually before the meal "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What do you call that cocktail again? A margarita?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob11aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to head to "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to leave; to go towards a destination "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'm heading to Paris tomorrow."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob11aud07"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of a special occasion you want to celebrate."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask your partner for help in planning a party."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Make 3 requests. Remember to be polite!"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Exchange roles with your partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about social occasions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I plan a celebration event. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make and respond to invitations."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I make and respond to requests."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn3le08ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn3le08ob11re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn3le08ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hey Peter! Can I talk to you?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: Sure! What's up?<br />\n<span class =\"strong